{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1500164-realms-of-pugmire-2e-kickstarter","id":1500164,"title":"Realms of Pugmire 2E Kickstarter!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-19T20:59:36-08:00","id":1500164,"title":"Realms of Pugmire 2E Kickstarter!","content":"By Monday Meeting Notes -<br /> <br /> <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> 2E will be the first Onyx Path Kickstarter in the late January of 2023! They already include new rules for Dogs, Cats and Rodents right away. \ud83d\ude0e #RoP2E","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-19-2023, 04:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-21T06:01:30-08:00","id":1500290,"title":"","content":"Well, you've kept your record for inaccurately reporting information, Wyrdhamster. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> There aren't &quot;new rules for dogs, cats, and rodents.&quot; It's a new edition, which means, yes, there are new rules. And yes, you will be able to emulate cats and rodents in the core rulebook. But that's not the same thing as &quot;new rules for dogs, cats, and rodents&quot; -- those will come (ideally) in subsequent books.<br /> <br /> I encourage folks who are interested in <i>accurate </i>information to check out theonyxpath.com, and further announcements coming from me! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T11:09:49-08:00","id":1500382,"title":"","content":"Quick, before they take down forum! \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> First official blog post on RoP 2E is about... THAT 2E will not steal your 1E books - and 2E will have Appendix on coversion of 1E materials to use with newer edition. Also, it's hinted that RoP quasi D&amp;D game engine could be used in future games of Onyx Path. \ud83d\ude0e <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/realms-of-pugmire-the-new-does-not-replace-the-old/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/realms-of-pugmire-the-new-does-not-replace-the-old/\" target=\"_blank\"> [Realms of Pugmire] New Doesn&rsquo;t Replace Old &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/realms-of-pugmire-the-new-does-not-replace-the-old/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/realms-of-pugmire-the-new-does-not-replace-the-old/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T01:48:08-08:00","id":1500708,"title":"","content":"<b>Eddy Webb</b> is doing smaller changes talks on OPP Discord at 2pm EST/1900 GMT every day for a while! They won't be recorded in any way - it's just Eddy chatting about the game and being available to answer questions. Stage channel <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TUhnhP8r\" target=\"_blank\"><b>pugmire-chat</b></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-19-2023, 04:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T00:34:53-08:00","id":1500819,"title":"","content":"In today's blog post Eddy talks about <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/realms-of-pugmire-random-doggo/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>new random generation of Pugmire characters</b></a> in RoP 2E. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> From yesterdays quick chat on Discord - Spellcasting - Spell Slots become Spell Points ( finally! ) and new spells have various powers levels, defencing from what spell level you cast them. Also, there will be added resurrection-type spell 'Second Chance'. No canonical implication for Church of Man if it's 'miracle sent from Men to Good Dogs' - or anything like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-20-2023, 04:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-24T12:09:44-08:00","id":1501254,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Realms of Pugmire 2E</b></a> Kickstarter has lunched<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg\" target=\"_blank\">! </a><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Best graphics in my opinion<br /> <br /> <img width=\"374\" height=\"576\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/039/700/885/bfbc09ef057f59d83f102e3c884d1b0c_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1674049049&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=e67304c6aa672ea76b5d7663802cec49\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/039/700/885/bfbc09ef057f59d83f102e3c884d1b0c_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1674049049&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=e67304c6aa672ea76b5d7663802cec49\" data-thumb-url=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/039/700/885/bfbc09ef057f59d83f102e3c884d1b0c_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1674049049&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=e67304c6aa672ea76b5d7663802cec49\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-27-2023, 03:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-24T13:22:43-08:00","id":1501261,"title":"","content":"Biggest rules change I see in the RoP 2E Preview 1 are changes to Attributes. Other changes are seems to be lesser than those. ( At least in Character Creation chapter )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Preview 1, p. 35'</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Each attribute ranges from -3 to +5. They are as follows:<br /> \u2022 <b>Agility:</b> Physical coordination and dexterity.<br /> \u2022 <b>Might:</b> Brute strength and the ability to apply physical force.<br /> \u2022 <b>Vitality:</b> Overall hardiness and resistance to pain.<br /> \u2022 <b>Cunning: </b>Wit, wisdom, and common sense.<br /> \u2022 <b>Intellect:</b> Mental skill and knowledge.<br /> \u2022 <b>Presence: </b>Social awareness and personality.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-27T10:51:47-08:00","id":1501465,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Design Dairy from Eddy - Converting from <b>Realms of Pugmire </b>1E to <b>RoP</b>2E - meaning for <b>Pugmire, Monarchies of Mau, Squeaks in the Deep</b> - is VERY simple. </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Major changes from 1E:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2022 Attributes are now only modifiers -3 to +5 - no full stats from 3 to 20</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2022 All Species can choose all Callings if the Guide agrees - Cat Artisan, Dog Minister, etc.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">\u2022 More Skills are pinned to Charisma / Presence - thus this Attribute becomes not only the 'beauty' of the character, but the understanding of social interactions - as well as resistances to them.</span><br /> \u200b<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=22euGlKDuFg\" data-code=\"22euGlKDuFg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/22euGlKDuFg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-27-2023, 04:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-27T11:15:54-08:00","id":1501474,"title":"","content":"Podcast from the devs of Onyx Path about the <b>OGL </b>drama in the RPG industry - and how it affected the writing of <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> 2E (TLDR: Not so much taken over by RoP. \ud83d\ude0e )<br /> <br /> Podcast Highlights:<br /> \u2022 20:15 - <b><i>The history of OGL stems from the fight against piracy in D&amp;D in 2000 - but it started with the beginning of D&amp;D in 1974 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i></b><br /> \u2022 29:00 - As <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> was written - why OGL was removed in 2E - and why it doesn't actually change anything in the game and can safely leave OGL, releasing its <b>Onyx20</b> mechanic (inspired by 5E).<br /> \u2022 36:20 \u2013 <b>History of a (not) lawsuit from <i>Vampire: the Masquerade</i> against an attempt to copy the entire brand to another game <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b><br /> \u2022 Bonus - Everything UNTIL 20:15 - Discussion about the 90s in culture and RPG. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/episode-244-realms-of-pugmire-and-the-ogl/\" target=\"_blank\">https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/e...e-and-the-ogl/</a>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-30T00:16:24-08:00","id":1501671,"title":"","content":"We have Guide Screen for the Realms 2E at 35k! Looking for next Strech Goals!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-02T21:33:19-08:00","id":1502007,"title":"","content":"We have $41k in the crowdfunding! Unlocked the Guide Screen and jumpstart (starting adventure with ready characters). The nearest Strech Goals are wallpapers with game graphics and a set of VTT tokens for the new edition. In an interview, Eddy Webb mentioned that he wants to fund official support for <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> on <b>Roll20</b> as well. (Not included in crowdfunding goals yet.)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/posts/3722336\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/3722336</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-08T06:53:25-08:00","id":1502511,"title":"","content":"The developers posted a <b>Conversion Guide from 1E to RoP 2E</b> for free on the Kickstarter blog. \u2764\ufe0f<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/posts/3726589\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/3726589</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-11T10:40:02-08:00","id":1502763,"title":"","content":"The Kickstarter for <b>Realms of Pugmire 2E </b>is going well, it will run for 12 more days. We recently unlocked VTT token packs with dogs and wallpapers for all backers. The next goals are the Introductory Adventure at $50k and <i><b>FULL ROP 2E SUPPORT ON ROLL20</b></i> at $55k! Let's make it happen!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/\u200b\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...bletop-rpg/\u200b</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}